{"id":"650401013847f443","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-beta-reduction.md","title":"β 与 η 归约","display":"df-beta-reduction — β 与 η 归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","[[56-df-lambda-term]]"],"display":"df-beta-reduction — β 与 η 归约","label":"56-df-beta-reduction","aliases":["56-df-beta-reduction"],"type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 10.1.14 and 10.1.16, printed pp551–552","source_ocr_block":"572–573","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beta-reduction — β 与 η 归约"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-beta-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-beta-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 10.1.14 and 10.1.16, printed pp551–552"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"572–573"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\">\\(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}\\)</span>，替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta\">\\(\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta\\)</span> 在原始项上定义，再按代表元存在量化下降到 α 商；用同一符号表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\)</span> 在断言中展开，是应用及抽象下的闭包条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;\\forall P\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;((MP,NP)\\in Q\\land(PM,PN)\\in Q\\land(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;\\forall P\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;((MP,NP)\\in Q\\land(PM,PN)\\in Q\\land(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\coloneqq\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M[x:=N]):x\\in V,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.(Mx),M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},x\\in V,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\coloneqq\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M[x:=N]):x\\in V,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.(Mx),M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},x\\in V,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land B\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\to_\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land H\\subseteq Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_\\beta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land B\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\to_\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land H\\subseteq Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\to_\\rho[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M&#39;\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M\\;\\exists N&#39;\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\;(M&#39;\\to_\\rho N&#39;)\\quad(\\rho\\in\\{\\beta,\\eta\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\to_\\rho[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M&#39;\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M\\;\\exists N&#39;\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\;(M&#39;\\to_\\rho N&#39;)\\quad(\\rho\\in\\{\\beta,\\eta\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definitions 10.1.14、10.1.16（印刷 pp551–552，OCR 页块572–573）。原文只给根部 β 实例，遗漏任意子项中的归约；现以最小相容闭包补齐。η 是收缩关系，HRS 中的长 η 正规形另行定义。原文 λ 项与归约序之间的伪依赖已去除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的 $\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 与 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}$，替换见 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]]。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 在原始项上定义，再按代表元存在量化下降到 α 商；用同一符号表示。$\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)$ 在断言中展开，是应用及抽象下的闭包条件。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的 $\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 与 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}$，替换见 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]]。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 在原始项上定义，再按代表元存在量化下降到 α 商；用同一符号表示。$\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)$ 在断言中展开，是应用及抽象下的闭包条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;\\forall P\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;((MP,NP)\\in Q\\land(PM,PN)\\in Q\\land(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).","display":true},{"tex":"B\\coloneqq\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M[x:=N]):x\\in V,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\},\\qquad H\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.(Mx),M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},x\\in V,x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_\\beta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land B\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\to_\\eta\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q:\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)\\land H\\subseteq Q\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\to_\\rho[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M'\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M\\;\\exists N'\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\;(M'\\to_\\rho N')\\quad(\\rho\\in\\{\\beta,\\eta\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":1921,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f6999282aa3dc01","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af80c4c087c85f9a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在无类型 λ 演算中取互异变量 $x,z,a,b\\in V$；令 $L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$[M]_\\alpha=[M]_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$\\to_\\beta$ 是 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的 α 商上归约关系。下式中 $\\Omega,I,K,N$ 均取商元素；两个商元素的应用和 $\\lambda b.I$ 取 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的商上构造。$\\mathrm{NF},\\mathrm{WNAt},\\mathrm{SNAt}$ 见相应 ARS 节点。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-beta-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"24bd3576f4c5852a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]] 的仅箭头片段，$F$ 是任意与变量不交的常元集，$\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}$ 固定。常元没有额外归约规则。$T_{\\mathrm{Ty}}=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}\\Lambda_A$，按同类型 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}$ 识别。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 是 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的商上收缩关系，包含全部应用及抽象上下文。$\\mathrm{SN}$ 是 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]] 的关系参数化谓词。"},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dfc4da988d3b91c0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A$；$M,N$ 为同一变量、常元签名上的原始项，$m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)$。类型语法与无捕获替换见 [[56-thm-typed-substitution]]，$E_\\tau$ 只允许同类型变量改名。$\\to_\\beta$、$\\to_\\eta$ 对原始项取原始关系，对商元素取 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的代表元存在式所定义的商关系。"}],"outgoing":["96add5833bb7dcac","d547d7414660f6bd"]}